skepu-dnn-model 1
# Small convolutional network for 28x28 grayscale images (MNIST), 10 classes
input 28 28 1
layer Conv2D features=8 kernel=3x3 weights=He_uniform biases=Zero activation=ReLU
layer MaxPooling2D kernel=2x2
layer Conv2D features=16 kernel=3x3 weights=He_uniform biases=Zero activation=ReLU
layer MaxPooling2D kernel=2x2
layer Flatten
layer Dense units=10 weights=Xavier_uniform biases=Zero activation=SoftMax
